(text "SanDisk DOC56-34-01508 Rev1.4 pp23,33–36. VDDi bypass 0.1–2.2uF; it must never power an external load.\nKeep bypass-loop inductance <3nH and resistance <0.5R. VSF test pads are service-only; keep their nearby ground accessible.\nTypical peak current at 25C: HS200 VCC 150mA / VCCQ 210mA; these are not worst-case power-budget guarantees." (at 15.24 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5de7e375-d521-5ae0-8265-24d387b2d08a"))
)
